{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32510","headline":"送友下第游鴈门 · 刘驾","name":"送友下第游鴈门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相别灞水湄，夹水柳依依。\n我愿醉如死，不见君去时。\n所诣星斗北，直行到犹迟。\n况复挈空囊，求人悲路岐。\n北门记室贤，爱我学古诗。\n待君如待我，此事固不疑。\n鴈门春色外，四月鴈未归。\n主人拂金台，延客夜开扉。\n舒君郁郁怀，饮彼白玉巵。\n若不化女子，功名岂无期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}